From 20d5df4d878d8d86ad7dc79b084d037702b31f44 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: emberloom-godot <emberloom-godot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 00:34:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] Add opaque-only colour copy and a real reset_accumulation
 signal

ViewportUpscaler.requires_opaque_color copies the colour buffer after the opaque
pass into render_buffers/color_opaque for reactive-mask generation.
RenderingServer.viewport_reset_accumulation() and render-buffer reconfiguration
now reset temporal history for one frame; FSR 2 and MetalFX temporal consume it
instead of the hard-coded false.
